{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_991.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"0f774a060bab9c7491b133285d64dca14d3f790cac4bc64a481c0a71d76caa32","ja":"アメちゃんの数だけ","zh":"按糖果的数量","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_991.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"9866564d7eeabd531e91440ff596a71bf9adeb15b5c37b22e7d9345c58be41ba","ja":"1週間後……。","zh":"1周后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_991.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"fc9025fa89c54103863f713f1bf8d5d5d66a1148109cd0dd9c8dce15c1069fdb","ja":"あ、りつこ～！\nお仕事終わったの～？","zh":"啊，律子～！\n工作结束了吗～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_991.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"05501ad53d981ccdca1d8ea075f562e280ea9713e841075faf45accf5f166dec","ja":"ええ、ちょうどさっきね。環はレッスン終わり？\nたしか奈緒も一緒だったわよね。","zh":"嗯，就刚才。环，你结束训练了吗？\n我记得奈绪也和你在一起吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_991.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"783c6bf86182a957fedbecf129913e4221a1ba6a24cfde61995a07c3017549c9","ja":"うん！　なおはもうちょっとやるって！\nたまきも一緒にやるぞーって言ったんだけど……。","zh":"嗯！奈绪说还要再做一会儿！我说环也要一起做来着……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_991.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"96c45fb9983200c1a22c3dd57b52b5e9243f4cd4364add7e79562700f91c0f42","ja":"夜遅くなるからって。なおがくれたアメちゃんパワーで\nたまき元気いっぱいなんだけどな～。","zh":"因为会很晚嘛。明明有奈绪给的糖果力量，环现在可是精神满满呢～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_991.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"71de98ec2b08315933f89915c0c1e3796002535ef398d7940656bd9da5afc7a4","ja":"ふふ、環もアメちゃんもらったのね♪","zh":"呵呵，环也拿到糖果了呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_991.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"3ed1704d135801cdbdf3e1b825fd806e42ff46e72e22f07d87af19777a4b8bcf","ja":"うん、いっぱいもらったぞ～！　くふふ♪","zh":"嗯，收到了好多～！咕呼呼♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_991.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"f2cadade9388184cb6063f937e3434ad32006838420a399aa218eb15918d48ca","ja":"いっぱい？　……うーん、もしかして\nまだイントネーションうまくいってなかった？","zh":"很多？……嗯——难道说，\n我的语调还是不太对？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_991.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"7c6959ce80b108e584c16de018b5ba07a07039597d0fc32779f90fd596335d5c","ja":"うん……。\nなお、なんかちょっと、落ち込んでる感じがしたぞ。","zh":"嗯……。\n\n奈绪好像有点消沉。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_991.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"dabc8ee5bcd96ef8cf1dbfd41a7a3ad4925f74393b4077ea928a0d163e4dd688","ja":"そう……全体の立稽古もあるし、\n無理してなきゃいいんだけど。","zh":"是啊……还要进行全体排练，\n希望没在勉强自己才好。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_991.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"a48e333b60b76bb47bdc729052423b131b96bd24f2e6f0d107855bc20643144e","ja":"あのね！　たまき、なおに何かしてあげたい！\nたまきがアメちゃんで元気になったみたいに！","zh":"那个！环也想为奈绪做点什么！就像环吃了糖果后打起精神来一样！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_991.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"1fef6708dd91cf0cf830488e3160371bdd92f058eb58566c83ae6c1afda4c543","ja":"……そうね！　じゃ、なにか差し入れしましょうか？\n奈緒が元気になってくれるもの、考えましょ。","zh":"……是啊！那要不要准备点慰问品？\n我们想想有什么能让奈绪打起精神来吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_991.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"5fe67f693f56fba1b49b822369086271189d2d7fc107671008f5236789647376","ja":"うん！　何がいいかな～……。","zh":"嗯！选什么好呢～……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_991.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"cd9c4a1b6d47b50e3587bcb9df0cf6eceff207f52c64a4ef8b02a8752eca5be6","ja":"翌日……。","zh":"第二天……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_991.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"9f389f7107fb483d04eb0f500f280dc995c394446df772417c4a6146246514f3","ja":"「ごめんなさい。私、記憶が……\nだから昔の事は、覚えてなくて」","zh":"“对不起。我……记不起事情了……\n所以，以前的事都不记得。”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_991.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"da5f81e3d3b14e494dff53d932fe75df41dbaa705b5af4229170b6220d46706d","ja":"「きっと、人違いだと思いま……。\n…………」","zh":"「我想，一定是认错人了……。\n…………」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_991.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"a0153ae121d5417519358207ee4ef18baf4de2a6bf974899ea2c60e8f4aaf1da","ja":"（はぁ……なんやようわからんようになってきた……\nどうしたらええんやろ……ん？）","zh":"（唉……越来越搞不懂了……\n该怎么办才好呢……嗯？）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_991.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"c94d02257e32d70dbd3e5d89a87712c3a0d6466981a764698c83f90f240dc2e5","ja":"（あれっ？　ドアのとこに、なんか置いてある。\nいつの間に……）","zh":"（咦？门边好像放着什么东西。\n什么时候放的……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_991.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"ded19ab7005c9737d42aa234100991c7e7692e1ba10b334e1ec28cac45f6f6fd","ja":"……っていうか、多っ！","zh":"……话说，也太多了吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
